    },
    "message": "feat: add skill feedback reference to every skill\n\nWhen a skill gives incorrect, outdated, or missing guidance, agents had no\ninstructions for reporting it, so the problem stayed with the user. Each\nskill now includes references/skill-feedback.md, which tells the agent to\nask the user, draft a GitHub issue on cloudflare/skills with a structured\nfield table, review it with the user, and post it with a\n`skill-feedback: <skill>:` title prefix. Each SKILL.md links to it.\n\nThe reference is copied into every skill because skills can be installed\nindividually.",
